  PUT /pre-consultation/session/patient_cluster_probe/
  
  Moderate / Borderline — Priya Sharma (34F Mumbai). Cardiometabolic + PCOS; cluster probe likely (65–80).
  
  Conditional — skip if lifestyle next_layer was patient_goals_priorities.
  
